WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.514
See where the bar went.

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:07.168
Put your phone to the side of the bar. Stand three to five metres back. Keep the whole lift in frame.

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:12.788
Record in the app, or import a clip from Photos. Trim it down to the lift.

00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:18.202
Circle one full-size weight plate on the first frame. That sets the scale.

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:23.450
Then it reads every frame on your phone. Your clip stays on your device.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.683
Every clip gets a grade and a peak speed. Three analyses a month are free.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:33.080
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
